{"type": "tool_call", "n": 20, "ts": 1790156018.0090408, "tool": "submit_memo", "args": {"text": "MARCH 2026 US AP & EXPENSE REVIEW - CLOSE SUMMARY\n\nDATE: April 3, 2026\nREVIEWED BY: Senior Accountant\nENTITY: Halvard Systems Inc. (US)\n\nISSUES IDENTIFIED & RESOLVED:\n\n1. DUPLICATE ENTRY (RESOLVED)\n   Entry: JE-00241 ($31,148.20)\n   Issue: Duplicate of JE-00232 for Stackline Cloud invoice STA-98877\n   Details: Identical invoice, amount, and support doc (DOC-0160)\n   Action: Reversed JE-00241; Posted reversal JE-00307\n   Impact: Eliminated $31,148.20 duplicate expense\n\n2. MISCODING - ACCOUNT CODE ERROR (RESOLVED)\n   Entry: JE-00250 ($3,880.00)\n   Issue: Northgate Data Centers colocation service miscoded to 6310 (Meals & Entertainment) instead of 5000 (Hosting & Infrastructure)\n   Details: Invoice NDC-7719 clearly states \"Colocation - 2 racks, power and cross-connects\" but memo incorrectly labeled it as \"team dinner\"\n   Action: Reversed JE-00250 (JE-00308), re-posted as JE-00309 to correct account 5000\n   Impact: Corrected infrastructure expense classification\n\n3. UNSUPPORTED ENTRY - ESCALATED\n   Entry: JE-00288 ($6,750.00)\n   Issue: \"Legal retainer\" manual entry posted with NO supporting documentation\n   Details: Posted 2026-03-24 by j.doe with no vendor invoice, contract, or proof of payment\n   Action: Flagged as Exception EXC-001 for controller review per policy\n   Impact: Requires documentation before close approval\n\nACCOUNT IMPACT SUMMARY:\n\u2022 Account 2000 (AP): Properly reflects remaining payables after duplicate reversal\n\u2022 Account 5000 (Hosting): Now correctly includes $3,880 colocation service\n\u2022 Account 6310 (Meals): Reduced by $3,880 after removing miscoded colocation expense\n\nSTATUS: Two errors corrected with supporting documentation. One unsupported entry escalated for controller decision.\n\nRECOMMENDATION: Approve corrected entries (JE-00307, JE-00308, JE-00309). Obtain supporting documentation for JE-00288 or have controller reject/reverse if documentation cannot be provided."}, "is_error": false, "result": {"status": "memo submitted; task complete"}, "ms": 10}
